1. user get system list
QUERY systems (QUERY GraphQL)
GET api/v1/user_roles/me?scope=system (permission: platform.system.read)

sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor FE as Platform FE
participant SYS as System BE
participant RBAC as RBAC BE

FE->>SYS: GET systems (GraphQL)
SYS->>RBAC: GET api/v1/user_roles/me?scope=system (permission: platform.system.read)
RBAC-->>RBAC: check permission
RBAC-->>RBAC: query the scope of the system from user_roles DB
RBAC-->>SYS: 200 [users[namespace]]

SYS-->>SYS: query all systems from System DB
SYS-->>FE: 200 [systems...]

2. Moderator create system
Create System (Mutation GraphQL)
POST api/v1/permissions/check (permission: platform.system.create)
POST api/v1/user_roles/owner (permission: platform.system.add_onwer)

sequenceDiagram
autonumber
actor FE as Platform FE
participant SYS as System BE
participant RBAC as RBAC BE

FE->>SYS: Create System (GraphQL)
SYS->>RBAC: POST api/v1/permissions/check (permission: platform.system.create)
RBAC-->>SYS: 200 (allow=true)
SYS->>RBAC: POST api/v1/user_roles/owner (permission: platform.system.add_onwer)
RBAC-->>SYS: 200
SYS-->>SYS: write system metadata (System DB)

SYS-->>FE: 201 {system metadata}

